{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 A Lone Soldier. A Dead City. A Nightmare That Never Ends. \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udc80</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city lies in ruins, overrun by a deadly plague and bloodthirsty zombies. Once full of life, it is now a wasteland of death. You are the last survivor\u2026 or so you think. Every alley is a death trap, every shadow hides something waiting to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Survival &amp; Exploration Horror</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>vast abandoned city</strong> filled with danger, secrets, and horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge <strong>weapons, ammo, and medical supplies</strong> to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>advanced AI enemies</strong> that stalk and ambush you unexpectedly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Intense Combat &amp; Tactical Survival</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>guns, melee weapons, and explosives</strong> to take down the undead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on <strong>stealth, movement, and strategic planning</strong> to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>realistic ballistics, destructible environments, and a deep survival system</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea7 <strong>A Wrecked, Unforgiving World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate <strong>crumbling buildings, abandoned streets, and wrecked cars</strong> that once stood as monuments to civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>rooftops, underground tunnels, and shelters</strong> to avoid danger and find resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Game Modes &amp; Challenges</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong>: Fight against hunger, infection, and relentless zombie hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Missions</strong>: Uncover the truth behind the terrifying outbreak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Survival Challenges</strong>: Can you last when ammo is scarce and death lurks around every corner?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>The city is against you. The monsters are hunting you. Fear is your only companion. Will you survive?</strong> \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598990?t=1759697674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598990?t=1759697674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598990/ba8e5e87009a075dbd62bbfb4c3cf21f223f4bca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759697674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598990/ba8e5e87009a075dbd62bbfb4c3cf21f223f4bca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759697674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 A Lone Soldier. A Dead City. A Nightmare That Never Ends. \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udc80</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city lies in ruins, overrun by a deadly plague and bloodthirsty zombies. Once full of life, it is now a wasteland of death. You are the last survivor\u2026 or so you think. Every alley is a death trap, every shadow hides something waiting to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Survival &amp; Exploration Horror</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>vast abandoned city</strong> filled with danger, secrets, and horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge <strong>weapons, ammo, and medical supplies</strong> to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>advanced AI enemies</strong> that stalk and ambush you unexpectedly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Intense Combat &amp; Tactical Survival</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>guns, melee weapons, and explosives</strong> to take down the undead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on <strong>stealth, movement, and strategic planning</strong> to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>realistic ballistics, destructible environments, and a deep survival system</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea7 <strong>A Wrecked, Unforgiving World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate <strong>crumbling buildings, abandoned streets, and wrecked cars</strong> that once stood as monuments to civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>rooftops, underground tunnels, and shelters</strong> to avoid danger and find resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Game Modes &amp; Challenges</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong>: Fight against hunger, infection, and relentless zombie hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Missions</strong>: Uncover the truth behind the terrifying outbreak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Survival Challenges</strong>: Can you last when ammo is scarce and death lurks around every corner?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>The city is against you. The monsters are hunting you. Fear is your only companion. Will you survive?</strong> \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udd25</p>","developers":["Mahmood Salih"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4